Reason: This `else` branch explicitly zeros the NAT-related fields when `CTA_EXPECT_NAT` is absent, preventing exposure of stale slab data. The preprocessor guard ensures the code only applies when CONFIG_NF_NAT is enabled, as these fields exist only under that configuration.

